Hello player! You've got a new update!!!


List of changes:

 One of Stalin's test subjects received a new mutation;
 Lighting has been fixed (the rays of the communists covered the face of cute Eva, now they are not so bright);
 Now, when you start the game, a hint will be visible if the WIFE has not yet realized that you need to talk to the HUSBAND;
 Now you will be told what to do near the legendary TIGRRRR tank;
 Super-soldiers came to help Stalin, be careful;
 Aircraft arrived to help the communists;
 The duration of the dialog box has been increased;


We are in Discord
Our Twitter

