Hello player! You have arrived again!

List of changes:

 Improved global illumination in the game;
 Fixed a bug when the character was tired and did not want to get up. Now at death, you will be reborn again;
 Fixed bug with interface size;
 Removed places that you do not need to see;
 [strike]Caught Poland[/strike]
 Fixed errors in some translations;
 Made a number of minor improvements to the process;
 We have removed the free camera, in the future we may return it, or maybe not, let's look at your behavior.


In the next update, we plan to add more content, stay tuned.

